<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy · Learn with me</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css">
<%- include('partials/adsense-verification') %>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar"><a class="brand" href="/">Learn with me</a></header>
<main class="container">
  <div class="legal">
    <h1>Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h1>
    <p class="muted">Last updated: <%= new Date().toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' }) %></p>

    <h2>1. Overview &amp; Finality of Sales</h2>
    <p>All digital memberships, subscriptions, passes, paid products, and services offered on <strong>Learn with me</strong> are final after successful payment and provisioning. Digital content and service access are made available immediately upon payment confirmation.</p>

    <h2>2. Subscription Cancellations</h2>
    <p>You may cancel your recurring subscriptions at any time through your <a href="/account">My Account</a> page or by contacting support at <a href="mailto:learnwithmegw@gmail.com">learnwithmegw@gmail.com</a>.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Preventing Renewal:</strong> Cancelling a recurring subscription stops all future automatic renewal charges.</li>
      <li><strong>Continued Access:</strong> Customer cancellation does not provide a refund for the current paid period or active access period. You will retain full access to your purchased paid products and content until the end of the current billing cycle or paid validity period.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>3. No Refund Policy</h2>
    <p>We do not offer partial or full refunds, credits, or prorated adjustments for processed payments, including:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Change of mind or accidental purchases.</li>
      <li>Unused or underutilized access during the validity period.</li>
      <li>Partial usage or cancellation prior to the end of a billing cycle.</li>
      <li>Failure to use or access the service during its validity period.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>4. Technical Issues &amp; Provisioning Resolution</h2>
    <p>If payment succeeds but your purchased service or product is not provisioned due to a technical issue attributable to our systems, please contact our support team at <a href="mailto:learnwithmegw@gmail.com">learnwithmegw@gmail.com</a> with your transaction details. We will investigate promptly and ensure appropriate resolution and access provisioning.</p>

    <h2>5. Contact Support</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions or require technical assistance with your account or purchases, please email us at <a href="mailto:learnwithmegw@gmail.com">learnwithmegw@gmail.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
